      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ARYA (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (31.00) in a Maiden at Q Parklands. The form out of last race has been strong. Can atone. SATISFIED (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Barefoot Johnny (20.16) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading chance. HARA'S RIPPER (6) makes his debut without a trial but profiles well for first outing. Expected to feature on debut. ANOTHER EQUAL (8) is a Raymond Burman-trained newcomer by Equalizer out of Champagne Jazzy. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Can run a bold race on debut.",
